---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Extreme Desktop ($2000+)" description="Best PC builds around $1,500 for maxed-out 1440p or 4K gaming.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Home</a>
    <p class="section-label" style="color: var(--accent-extreme);">Extreme · $2000+</p>
    <h1>Extreme<br />desktop.</h1>
    <p>If you're just looking to play some casual games this is overkill. This is no compromises. Maxed-out 1440p or smooth 4K — these builds handle anything you throw at them.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-content">
    <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Recommended builds</div>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Builds coming soon — check back shortly.</p>

    <div class="build-placeholder">
      🔧 Build recommendations will live here. Each card will include a full parts list, where to buy, and expected performance.
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>